   "rating": 5,
   "date": "2 years ago",
   "name": "Dan Mitchell",
   "text": "Mark was fantastic from first contact to the finished article. Nothing was too much trouble and he was quick to deal with any issues or changes we had (including sorting out some replacement panels that had not been properly checked by the kitchen supplier!)\n\nMark did an incredible amount of work which was completed within a reasonable budget and the timeframe he gave us. I'd recommend him for any projects.",
   "owner_reply": ""
  },
  {
   "rating": 5,
   "date": "a year ago",
   "name": "Laura Steedman",
   "text": "Mark did a brilliant job with my kitchen. He knocked down an internal arch, put up a new wall, stripped and got rid of the old kitchen and fitted an entire new kitchen.\n\nIt was even better than I'd hoped for. He was very professional and polite. He kept me updated all the way through. I'm really pleased with the end product and would definitely recommend him to others.",
   "owner_reply": ""
  },
  {
   "rating": 5,
   "date": "3 years ago",
